		(descr "Heling MJ88-B011-HLSV6-P (LCSC C501463) sink-mount (board cutout) 8P8C RJ45, no magnetics, no LEDs, brass belt shell, tab down, SMT, 6.80 mm above / 4.70 mm below the board top. Land per drawing WI-061-170 A02 (Jack Top View): signal pads 0.70 x 2.40 at 1.02 pitch, 8.90-11.30 mm from the edge; pegs 1.85 at +-5.97, 9.80 from the edge; shell tabs 2.55 x 4.30 (inner edges 14.30 apart) with a 1.00 nub hole at +-8.625, 3.00 from the edge. Cutout drawn 13.59 x 7.90, here 13.68 x 8.00 (Dwgs.User). Face 2.35 mm past the edge. Origin = cutout centre on the edge line.")
